Stop, Ichijo!

02:31.527 --> 02:32.428
Stop, Ichijo!

02:32.828 --> 02:34.363
Ichijo!

02:38.167 --> 02:39.335
Deep...

02:39.368 --> 02:40.102
It is deep...

02:40.102 --> 02:40.770
It is deep...

02:40.903 --> 02:42.471
