02:43.305 --> 02:45.007
Could she be in Brazil again?

02:45.007 --> 02:45.341
Could she be in Brazil again?

02:48.177 --> 02:49.912
Possibly.

02:49.912 --> 02:50.179
Possibly.

02:51.047 --> 02:52.314
What is it?

02:52.314 --> 02:53.983
Oh, nothing.

02:53.983 --> 02:54.650
W-Welcome back, I guess?

02:54.650 --> 02:56.641
W-Welcome back, I guess?

02:58.020 --> 02:59.112
Oh, hey.

03:01.524 --> 03:02.792
No. 6...

03:02.792 --> 03:04.988
Ah, Miss Miyamoto!

03:05.928 --> 03:07.263
What are you doing?

03:07.263 --> 03:09.265
It's a crossword puzzle.

03:09.265 --> 03:12.068
Why don't you do stuff like that at home?

03:12.068 --> 03:15.436
Well, actually, this is for Himeko, so...

03:15.638 --> 03:16.338
What?

03:16.338 --> 03:17.006
Himeko asked me to take care of it for her, so...

03:17.006 --> 03:17.640
Himeko asked me to take care of it for her, so...

03:17.640 --> 03:19.175
Himeko asked me to take care of it for her, so...

03:19.175 --> 03:21.010
What the heck was she thinking, anyway?

03:21.010 --> 03:22.278
Asking other people to solve
a crossword puzzle for her...

03:22.278 --> 03:25.815
Oh yeah, there's one part that I can't get.
Can you help?

03:25.815 --> 03:27.717
O-Okay...

03:27.717 --> 03:30.920
It's "An aquatic creature which
represents the Cambrian period."

03:30.920 --> 03:35.491
It's eight letters long, begins with "sa"
and ends with "u." Do you know what it is?

03:35.491 --> 03:36.926
"Sanyochu."

03:36.926 --> 03:38.961
Wow, I see! I knew you would know it!

03:38.961 --> 03:41.397
You're the walking encyclopedia of the year!

03:41.397 --> 03:43.024
Pshaw!

03:43.365 --> 03:44.127
Huh?

03:44.600 --> 03:46.035
What are those?

03:46.035 --> 03:50.139
Oh, they asked me to buy them
for them because they're busy.

03:50.139 --> 03:51.874
This eraser is for Kurumi,

03:51.874 --> 03:53.609
the flashcards are for Rei

03:53.609 --> 03:55.177
and the miso soup is for Miss Ichijo.

03:55.177 --> 03:58.447
They're busy?! I can't believe them...

03:58.447 --> 04:01.450
Hey, No. 6, you should just say no
to stuff like that.

04:01.450 --> 04:04.153
Personally, I don't mind.

04:04.153 --> 04:06.222
You're such a nice person.

04:06.222 --> 04:08.122
I'm just normal.

04:08.791 --> 04:10.725
Normal, huh?

04:11.527 --> 04:14.430
Anyway, why would Ichijo want miso soup?

04:14.430 --> 04:15.498
Dunno...

04:15.498 --> 04:15.831
Maho!

04:15.831 --> 04:17.099
Maho!

04:18.100 --> 04:19.869
Let's do that again tomorrow, okay?

04:20.302 --> 04:20.503
Oh, hey.

04:20.503 --> 04:21.570
Oh, hey.

04:23.939 --> 04:25.508
Hello, Admiral!

04:25.508 --> 04:26.909
Who are you calling "Admiral"?

04:26.909 --> 04:27.977
Grand tea master, then.

04:27.977 --> 04:28.944
Wrong!

04:28.944 --> 04:30.980
No. 6, have you finished the puzzle?

04:30.980 --> 04:31.213
Yes, thanks to Miss Miyamoto, it's all done!

04:31.213 --> 04:34.383
Yes, thanks to Miss Miyamoto, it's all done!

04:34.750 --> 04:35.885
Maho!

04:36.185 --> 04:38.053
Yaay! It's finished!

04:38.053 --> 04:38.754
Yaay! It's finished!

04:38.754 --> 04:40.256
I don't understand what you're so excited for.

04:40.256 --> 04:40.689
I don't understand what you're so excited for.

04:40.790 --> 04:42.458
Here's your eraser, Kurumi.

04:42.458 --> 04:43.793
Oh, thank you!

04:44.260 --> 04:45.961
And here are your flashcards, Rei!

04:45.961 --> 04:47.096
I appreciate it!

04:47.096 --> 04:49.498
And miso soup for Miss Ichijo!

04:49.498 --> 04:50.829
I'm deeply grateful!

04:52.201 --> 04:53.896
I don't get it.

04:56.672 --> 04:59.542
Well, I have to go some place, so...

04:59.542 --> 05:00.941
Huh?

05:01.443 --> 05:03.207
Thanks, No. 6!

05:03.279 --> 05:05.014
Thank you for all your trouble.

05:05.014 --> 05:06.379
See you tomorrow!

05:07.817 --> 05:09.185
Good-bye!

05:09.185 --> 05:10.653
Bye!

05:13.189 --> 05:14.714
Hey, all of you!

05:14.857 --> 05:15.691
Maho?

05:15.691 --> 05:17.760
What's up? Why do you look so mad?

05:17.760 --> 05:19.819
What do you think No. 6 is?!

05:20.362 --> 05:21.430
A human.

05:21.430 --> 05:22.998
That's not it!

05:22.998 --> 05:24.667
She's not a human?

05:24.667 --> 05:26.502
That's not what I meant!

05:26.502 --> 05:29.405
You need to stop asking No. 6
to do everything for you!

05:29.405 --> 05:32.942
It's not good for No. 6 or for you!

05:32.942 --> 05:35.377
Take care of your own stuff!

05:37.213 --> 05:39.238
Becky, you sound like a teacher!

05:40.816 --> 05:42.852
Grrr! I am a teacher!

05:42.852 --> 05:44.887
There, there.

05:44.887 --> 05:46.522
Stop patting my head!

05:46.522 --> 05:47.580
Then, here!

05:51.627 --> 05:53.595
Hau hau hau hau...

05:57.032 --> 05:58.830
It's just about time.

06:27.229 --> 06:29.288
Oh, that was...

06:33.269 --> 06:35.397
It's morning!

06:37.339 --> 06:40.172
For your information,
I'm Kurusu from the Film Club!

06:40.943 --> 06:43.178
Like I said, Miss Nanjo,

06:43.178 --> 06:45.408
would you mind walking a little
farther away from us?

06:45.781 --> 06:47.883
Oh dear, why would you ask that?

06:47.883 --> 06:49.851
Why?!

06:52.721 --> 06:54.290
Wipe the drool off!

06:54.290 --> 06:55.858
Isn't he just adorable?

06:55.858 --> 06:57.019
How is that?!

06:58.127 --> 06:59.962
Hey, Miyako!

06:59.962 --> 07:02.090
Mahohoi!

07:02.698 --> 07:04.496
Oh, it's that idiot girl.

07:04.633 --> 07:05.896
What's going on?

07:07.303 --> 07:08.671
A convertible?

07:08.671 --> 07:10.639
Isn't it omega-cool?

07:10.639 --> 07:14.276
Come on, my baby is a hundred times
cooler than that.

07:14.276 --> 07:15.641
Isn't that right, Yagizaburo?

07:16.245 --> 07:18.737
All right, fine! Just wipe the drool off that thing!

07:20.916 --> 07:22.384
I wonder whose car it is.

07:22.384 --> 07:25.479
It has to belong to someone associated
with our school.

07:26.655 --> 07:28.824
It has an invisible roof!

07:28.824 --> 07:31.193
You don't have to put it in a weird way like that.

07:31.193 --> 07:32.962
I wonder what kind of car it is.

07:32.962 --> 07:34.363
It's a Midget.

07:34.363 --> 07:35.531
Huh?

07:35.531 --> 07:37.700
It's an old British car.

07:37.700 --> 07:41.102
It looks like it's permitted to park
on school premises now.

07:41.303 --> 07:42.566
Huh?

07:42.972 --> 07:46.875
The wind that comes through the
triangle window feels great!

07:46.875 --> 07:48.577
Triangle window?

07:48.577 --> 07:50.145
How would you know that?

07:50.145 --> 07:53.012
What? Oh, that's because...

07:54.049 --> 07:55.608
Hmm?

07:55.684 --> 07:58.821
Oh, isn't this the same car you were
riding in the other day,

07:58.821 --> 08:00.122
No. 67

08:00.122 --> 08:00.990
What?

08:00.990 --> 08:02.324
Riding in?

08:02.324 --> 08:03.559
What do you mean by that?

08:03.559 --> 08:08.731
I saw her riding in this car by
the riverside one evening.

08:08.731 --> 08:11.834
The riverside in the evening... How romantic!

08:11.834 --> 08:15.571
Why don't you run along the riverside
with Yagizaburo, too, Miss Nanjo?

08:15.571 --> 08:17.266
I think it'd be romantic.

08:17.740 --> 08:20.801
Must be nice! No. 6 got to ride in it!

08:22.978 --> 08:25.714
So whose car is this?

08:25.714 --> 08:27.483
Oh, that's...

08:27.483 --> 08:30.119
It was too dark to see the person's face,

08:30.119 --> 08:32.187
but it was your boyfriend
who was driving it, wasn't it?

08:32.187 --> 08:33.055
What?!

08:33.055 --> 08:35.456
Did you say "BOYFRIEND"?!

08:35.591 --> 08:38.994
Yes, I saw them having a good time
chatting with each other!

08:38.994 --> 08:41.130
I-It wasn't!

08:41.130 --> 08:43.599
You don't have to hide it from us, No. 6!

08:43.665 --> 08:45.667
It's not like that at all!

08:45.667 --> 08:46.735
Who? Who is he?

08:46.735 --> 08:48.362
Who do you like? Tell us!

08:48.437 --> 08:50.371
Who do I like?

08:53.542 --> 08:55.377
Hey, No. 6!

08:55.377 --> 08:56.401
Oh dear...

08:57.446 --> 08:59.676
No. 6 in love, huh?

09:03.085 --> 09:05.179
It's a carp, meow.

09:05.587 --> 09:07.289
Why?

09:07.289 --> 09:09.189
It's fresh out of the water, meow.

09:09.725 --> 09:11.226
Where did you...

09:11.226 --> 09:13.429
It's body temperature, meow.

09:13.429 --> 09:15.230
I don't get it.

09:17.800 --> 09:20.602
Listen. This is going to be on the test!

09:20.602 --> 09:20.932
Listen. This is going to be on the test!

09:25.507 --> 09:27.066
This isn't good...

09:31.180 --> 09:32.548
Hey, worm!

09:32.548 --> 09:34.116
Don't call me worm!

09:42.791 --> 09:43.986
Hey, Plain Girl.

09:50.065 --> 09:51.567
Miss Ichijo!

09:51.733 --> 09:52.768
Yes? Can I help you?

09:52.768 --> 09:52.935
Yes? Can I help you?

09:52.935 --> 09:53.135
Yes? Can I help you?

09:54.103 --> 09:55.170
Huh? What's that?

09:55.170 --> 09:55.370
Huh? What's that?

09:55.437 --> 09:57.940
Oh, n-n-nothing!

09:59.341 --> 10:01.910
Stop playing around during class!

10:07.549 --> 10:08.450
Shhh...

10:08.450 --> 10:08.584
Shhh...

10:09.451 --> 10:10.452
Shhh...

10:13.889 --> 10:15.190
DON'T EAT IT!

10:15.290 --> 10:18.227
Kurumi! Rei! Miyako! Get up!

10:18.227 --> 10:19.695
Stay like that for a while.

10:19.695 --> 10:21.130
Yes, ma'am...

10:31.006 --> 10:31.874
Didn't she eat that?

10:31.874 --> 10:32.808
Didn't she eat that?

10:36.145 --> 10:38.280
Looks like she got it, so it's good.

10:38.280 --> 10:39.941
Wh-What is it?

10:41.717 --> 10:43.685
What's the matter, Himeko?

10:43.685 --> 10:45.087
Ma...

10:45.087 --> 10:45.110
Ma...

10:46.121 --> 10:47.156
Crap!

10:47.156 --> 10:47.489
Crap!

10:48.423 --> 10:50.626
Hey, what do you think you're doing, Himeko?!

10:50.626 --> 10:53.996
Oh, it's just between me and her.
Pay us no mind!

10:53.996 --> 10:57.366
I do mind! We're in the middle of class!
Go back to your seat!

10:57.699 --> 11:00.802
So who's the lucky guy you like, No. 67

11:00.802 --> 11:00.893
So who's the lucky guy you like, No. 67

11:02.404 --> 11:04.106
Hey, Himeko!

11:04.106 --> 11:06.308
I want you to tell me.

11:06.308 --> 11:06.638
I want you to tell me.

11:06.875 --> 11:09.511
L-Like I said, it's not like that.

11:09.511 --> 11:10.774
Ma?

11:11.213 --> 11:12.738
Take her away!

11:14.316 --> 11:15.150
Good work, everyone!

11:15.150 --> 11:15.517
Good work, everyone!

11:18.353 --> 11:20.117
That idiot Himeko...

11:20.189 --> 11:22.824
There's no way we can get the
information out of her now.

11:23.125 --> 11:26.228
Rei, come to my research room after class.

11:26.228 --> 11:27.596
Yeah, yeah.

11:37.839 --> 11:39.241
Sh-She's in love?!

11:39.241 --> 11:40.976
That's what it looks like.

11:40.976 --> 11:43.679
You want to know who he is too, right, Becky?

11:43.679 --> 11:46.348
D-Don't be silly. Just leave her alone!

11:46.348 --> 11:48.684
But we want to know!

11:48.684 --> 11:52.154
It'd be horrible if you kept bothering her
just because you're curious.

11:52.154 --> 11:53.655
Why?!

11:53.655 --> 11:54.816
Oh, stop it!

11:55.157 --> 11:56.858
Yeah, she has a point.

11:56.858 --> 11:57.793
Rei?

11:57.793 --> 12:00.160
We were wrong, Becky.

12:00.696 --> 12:03.498
We're not going to try to find out who
No. 6's boyfriend is any more.

12:03.498 --> 12:04.866
Rei!

12:04.866 --> 12:08.666
There's a possibility he's one of
the teachers you're close to.

12:09.972 --> 12:12.908
But it's not good to be so nosey, is it?

12:13.942 --> 12:16.678
So we just have to find out who
the owner of the car is, right?

12:16.678 --> 12:18.814
Yeah. He's the one.

12:18.814 --> 12:20.015
All right! Let me handle this!

12:23.552 --> 12:26.221
Oh boy, am I exhausted!

12:26.221 --> 12:29.057
Oh yeah, do you know the
convertible parked outside?

12:29.091 --> 12:32.493
Whose car is it anyway?
I'd love to ride in it, you know?

12:33.528 --> 12:37.260
Really? Then why don't we take
a ride in it together later?

12:42.504 --> 12:44.673
That was unexpected, wasn't it?

12:44.673 --> 12:46.975
Yeah, I didn't see that one coming!

12:47.276 --> 12:49.611
Sayaka Suzuki, AKA No. 6.

12:49.611 --> 12:52.672
It's unclear why she's called "No. 6," huh?

12:53.015 --> 12:54.608
I wonder why.

12:54.683 --> 12:55.717
Yeah.

12:55.717 --> 12:56.985
Judging from my personal examination,

12:56.985 --> 13:03.892
I suppose her giving and devoted personality
is due to her unfortunate family circumstances.

13:03.892 --> 13:04.518
I see.

13:05.560 --> 13:08.894
Her father must talk abusively and
do whatever he pleases.

13:09.164 --> 13:10.432
But if she rebelled against him,

13:10.432 --> 13:12.662
that would sadden her mother
that she cares so much about.

13:12.734 --> 13:16.838
And that made her naturally develop
a devoted personality.

13:16.838 --> 13:18.206
Man, that's tragic.

13:18.206 --> 13:21.476
She's the youngest of six kids,

13:21.476 --> 13:25.881
but her father wouldn't try to remember his own
kids' names because he lived a fast life.

13:25.881 --> 13:28.750
Oh! So he'd call his oldest kid No. 1,
and the second one No. 2!

13:28.750 --> 13:31.787
Exactly! That's why she's No. 6!

13:31.787 --> 13:33.722
I don't think that's the case at all.

13:33.722 --> 13:35.424
Wanna bet?

13:35.424 --> 13:37.392
Fine. I take your challenge.

13:37.392 --> 13:39.486
I bet 1,000,000 yen on me being wrong!

13:39.561 --> 13:41.154
Enough already!

13:41.396 --> 13:44.132
You see, people have different tastes, so...

13:44.132 --> 13:47.169
She's right. Age doesn't matter
as long as they love each other.

13:47.169 --> 13:48.694
But there's a limit to it!

13:48.770 --> 13:50.135
I guess you're right...

13:50.739 --> 13:53.942
Who knows, it could be a disguise.

13:53.942 --> 13:55.603
You mean, Old Geezer?

13:56.945 --> 13:58.914
Hi, I'm Jacky!

13:58.914 --> 14:00.882
I came to Japan hoping to meet
beautiful Japanese girls!

14:00.882 --> 14:02.451
I came to Japan hoping to meet
beautiful Japanese girls!

14:03.719 --> 14:05.420
Not mine.

14:05.420 --> 14:08.223
Jacky! I think he's mach-cool!

14:08.223 --> 14:09.054
It was hers.

14:09.491 --> 14:10.492
Maho!

14:10.492 --> 14:12.027
Cripes!

14:12.027 --> 14:15.764
Anyway, what is it about Old Geezer
that No. 6 is attracted to?

14:17.766 --> 14:21.168
Data on Old Geezer? Sure, I have it.

14:21.937 --> 14:22.665
Here you go.

14:25.540 --> 14:28.643
Hey, nothing's on here.

14:28.643 --> 14:30.579
And it says his name is "Old Geezer," too...

14:30.579 --> 14:32.981
Isn't that enough?

14:32.981 --> 14:34.416
How is that enough?

14:34.416 --> 14:36.952
Why don't you do more proper research?

14:36.952 --> 14:38.920
Because I'm not interested!

14:38.920 --> 14:41.981
She's not interested? But she's in the
Intelligence Department, isn't she?

14:43.158 --> 14:44.284
That's a problem.

14:44.826 --> 14:46.027
Maho.

14:46.027 --> 14:49.564
Now that it's come to this, I guess we have no
choice but to investigate it on our own.

14:49.564 --> 14:51.430
Why does she look like a thief?

14:51.867 --> 14:53.767
All right, I'll go!

14:53.869 --> 14:54.970
Becky?

14:54.970 --> 14:58.338
Old Geezer is supposed to give me
a ride in his car anyway.

14:59.074 --> 15:01.877
You know, just thinking about my dear student,

15:01.877 --> 15:03.743
I can't help worrying about her.

15:04.413 --> 15:06.381
Becky...

15:06.848 --> 15:08.782
Don't you look down on your teacher!

15:10.619 --> 15:12.644
It's after school hours.

15:19.060 --> 15:20.262
Hi.

15:20.262 --> 15:22.197
Why?

15:22.197 --> 15:24.065
I'm machine-sitting.

15:24.065 --> 15:26.435
Um, would you like one?

15:26.435 --> 15:27.502
No, I don't want it!

15:27.502 --> 15:29.766
I need to fulfill my sales quota...

15:30.238 --> 15:31.364
Quota?

15:32.207 --> 15:34.369
Sorry to keep you waiting, sir!

15:34.509 --> 15:35.677
Huh?

15:35.677 --> 15:36.077
Hop in.

15:36.077 --> 15:36.445
Hop in.

15:36.445 --> 15:36.912
Hop in.

15:36.912 --> 15:36.935
Hop in.

15:37.112 --> 15:38.146
Get out of the car.

15:38.146 --> 15:38.313
Vroom!

15:38.313 --> 15:38.580
Vroom!

15:38.580 --> 15:38.847
Vroom!

15:38.847 --> 15:39.014
Vroom!

15:39.014 --> 15:39.247
Vroom!

15:39.681 --> 15:41.410
Please, just get out.

15:42.184 --> 15:43.452
Sorry about that.

15:43.452 --> 15:45.554
I forgot the key.

15:45.554 --> 15:47.579
I changed my mind. Can I just go home?

15:49.291 --> 15:51.350
Come on, go get up close and personal
with Old Geezer!

15:58.667 --> 15:59.600
Are you okay?

15:59.668 --> 16:01.970
I-I'm totally okay!

16:01.970 --> 16:03.905
Becky, do you want me to switch with you?

16:03.905 --> 16:05.031
Are you serious?

16:09.077 --> 16:09.978
Let me off!

16:09.978 --> 16:11.613
Stop the car, you murderer!

16:11.613 --> 16:13.815
Is Becky going to be okay?

16:13.815 --> 16:15.112
Dunno.

16:15.851 --> 16:17.719
Namu...

16:17.719 --> 16:18.987
It's too early for that!

16:18.987 --> 16:21.513
Becky, please come back alive!

16:21.823 --> 16:24.226
Hey, what are you guys doing?

16:24.226 --> 16:25.660
Miss Igarashi?

16:25.660 --> 16:28.964
Hey, Old Geezer! Drive properly!

16:28.964 --> 16:32.133
Ah, sorry about that. It's been forty years
since the last time I drove!

16:32.133 --> 16:32.998
WHAT?!

16:33.368 --> 16:35.537
Jeez, he'd better drive carefully!

16:35.537 --> 16:38.268
It took me three years to find that car!

16:38.473 --> 16:39.274
WHAT?!

16:39.274 --> 16:41.243
This isn't your car?

16:41.243 --> 16:43.177
No, I'm just borrowing it.

16:43.745 --> 16:46.047
So it's Miss Igarashi's car.

16:46.047 --> 16:47.481
Take me back!

16:47.916 --> 16:49.217
They're gone...

16:49.217 --> 16:50.707
Becky!

16:52.187 --> 16:54.956
Miss Igarashi, why is Old Geezer
driving your car?

16:54.956 --> 17:00.295
Well... The powers that be told me I can't
park that car inside school premises.

17:00.295 --> 17:01.596
But the old teacher negotiated
with them for me and...

17:01.596 --> 17:02.831
But the old teacher negotiated
with them for me and...

17:02.831 --> 17:03.331
But the old teacher negotiated
with them for me and...

17:03.331 --> 17:05.500
So just to show my thanks, I let him drive it...

17:05.500 --> 17:07.669
So that's what happened.

17:07.669 --> 17:09.137
Maho...

17:09.404 --> 17:10.772
But wait a second...

17:10.772 --> 17:11.973
So that means...

17:11.973 --> 17:14.408
No. 6's partner in love is...

17:14.676 --> 17:15.510
Hey!

17:15.510 --> 17:16.778
In love?!

17:16.778 --> 17:18.847
Wow! I had no idea!

17:18.847 --> 17:19.114
Maho!

17:19.114 --> 17:20.048
Maho!

17:20.048 --> 17:20.173
Maho!

17:20.615 --> 17:22.984
It is indeed forbidden love.

17:22.984 --> 17:24.753
It's almost like a rock loving another rock,

17:24.753 --> 17:26.778
and scissors loving other scissors...

17:27.989 --> 17:29.324
I don't get that analogy...

17:29.324 --> 17:32.527
So No. 6 likes girls!

17:32.527 --> 17:34.729
I think that's omega-unexpected!

17:34.729 --> 17:36.264
That's not true!

17:36.264 --> 17:37.390
Huh?

17:40.602 --> 17:42.229
No. 6...

17:43.371 --> 17:46.141
That's not true! It's not like that at all!

17:46.141 --> 17:49.839
Everyone is completely
misunderstanding of the year!

17:54.282 --> 17:57.085
Stop it! Stop it, Old Geezer!

17:57.085 --> 17:57.652
Stop it! Stop it, Old Geezer!

18:03.291 --> 18:04.826
I don't care! Just stop the damn thing!

18:04.826 --> 18:05.190
I don't care! Just stop the damn thing!

18:12.200 --> 18:15.003
What do you mean we're
misunderstanding, No. 6?

18:15.003 --> 18:17.105
Well, because...

18:17.105 --> 18:19.341
You mean this isn't about "love"?

18:19.341 --> 18:23.300
Right, it's not like that, but it's, um...

18:27.482 --> 18:28.984
She turned red.

18:28.984 --> 18:31.009
So you do like her.

18:31.219 --> 18:36.157
Yes, I do. I like Miss lgarashi... very much.

18:36.157 --> 18:37.784
Maho!

18:38.226 --> 18:39.594
What an explosive statement!

18:39.594 --> 18:43.365
But, but this is not love or anything like that.

18:43.365 --> 18:46.266
It's more like... um...

18:47.469 --> 18:48.994
It's admiration, isn't it?

18:52.440 --> 18:54.442
Yes, it is.

18:54.442 --> 18:55.844
Admiration?

18:55.844 --> 18:58.006
For a boozer like her?!

18:58.847 --> 18:59.681
Oww...

18:59.681 --> 19:02.017
Excuse me for being a boozer!

19:02.017 --> 19:04.119
Don't thump my forehead! It'll scar!

19:04.119 --> 19:04.919
Don't thump my forehead! It'll scar!

19:05.220 --> 19:06.821
DON'T BUFF IT!

19:07.055 --> 19:07.681
Ma?

19:14.029 --> 19:15.895
Miss lgarashi...

19:21.803 --> 19:24.639
Oh, so that's what it was all about.

19:24.639 --> 19:28.076
We apologize for making
a big deal out of it, No. 6!

19:28.076 --> 19:29.475
We're
sorry!

19:29.711 --> 19:33.715
It's okay. I have to apologize for not
being very clear, too.

19:33.715 --> 19:38.787
But what made you ride in
Miss Igarashi's car to begin with, No. 67

19:38.787 --> 19:41.779
I just happened to see her. Right?

19:42.424 --> 19:43.255
Yes.

19:43.892 --> 19:46.224
When I was breaking in the car...

19:47.729 --> 19:51.032
Since doing it with someone else
is more fun than doing it alone,

19:51.032 --> 19:54.366
I asked her to ride with me every now and then.

19:55.737 --> 20:00.140
Miss Igarashi looks so cool when she drives.

20:03.111 --> 20:05.671
Hmm, the parking brake is kind of loose.

20:07.816 --> 20:11.252
Shut up! Haven't you heard of gravity before?!

20:18.960 --> 20:22.988
I'm going to try hard and
be like you, Miss Igarashi!

20:24.132 --> 20:25.667
You're making me blush!

20:25.667 --> 20:28.269
I'm not really all THAT cool, you know!

20:28.269 --> 20:30.033
Right, you're a boozer, aren't you?

20:30.739 --> 20:32.307
Owww...

20:32.307 --> 20:34.042
Not my forehead!

20:34.042 --> 20:35.376
There, there.

20:35.376 --> 20:36.866
DON'T BUFF IT!

20:42.050 --> 20:43.852
Hey, they're back!

20:43.852 --> 20:46.821
Looks like my beloved car is safe and sound.

20:49.357 --> 20:51.726
Boy, I had a wonderful time with it!

20:51.726 --> 20:53.461
Welcome back.

20:53.461 --> 20:55.088
Becky! How is Becky?

20:57.132 --> 20:58.224
She's dead.

20:59.501 --> 21:00.969
I heard that even after all that,

21:00.969 --> 21:03.271
they've been going for rides
together quite often.

21:03.271 --> 21:07.809
I see. It was a surprisingly good story, wasn't it?

21:07.809 --> 21:09.334
Yes, I think so, too.

21:09.410 --> 21:11.742
Except for one particular victim, that is.

21:12.447 --> 21:13.243
Hmm?

21:14.249 --> 21:15.683
A car!

21:16.584 --> 21:19.921
Hau hau hau hau...

21:35.203 --> 21:36.504
Are you awake?

21:36.504 --> 21:37.806
Are you going out?

21:37.806 --> 21:40.475
Midnight, chatting

21:40.475 --> 21:43.144
Friends, lovers

21:43.144 --> 21:45.747
Online chat friends, buddies

21:45.747 --> 21:50.742
Can we meet? Where are you?

21:51.152 --> 21:56.491
I still don't eat or give stuff like love

21:56.491 --> 22:01.796
I get hungry, so add a dessert for me

22:01.796 --> 22:04.399
A throw-in is no good

22:04.399 --> 22:06.766
Everything must be the main dish

22:07.135 --> 22:12.440
Everyday, nice to meet you

22:12.440 --> 22:17.745
Everybody, you and I

22:17.745 --> 22:22.851
Teach me the ABCs of love

22:22.851 --> 22:25.720
Go, go, school carnival

22:25.720 --> 22:28.423
Go, go, special serious love

22:28.423 --> 22:33.728
It dives into dreams and flies away

22:33.728 --> 22:36.397
Go, go, school carnival

22:36.397 --> 22:39.133
Go, go, sweet fall in love

22:39.133 --> 22:41.769
Dramatic

22:41.769 --> 22:44.405
Check your temperature, pure pure

22:44.405 --> 22:47.075
Obviously shy-matic

22:47.075 --> 22:50.010
Heart-matic girl-uppi

23:01.756 --> 23:04.125
I'm a miso soup fairy!

23:04.125 --> 23:06.287
I'm Ichijo, the class rep.

23:06.828 --> 23:09.631
I'll make one of your wishes come true!

23:09.631 --> 23:14.402
Please make him a protected animal
under the Washington Convention.

23:14.402 --> 23:16.894
So I'll be protected?

23:18.907 --> 23:20.742
It would still be pointless, you know?

23:20.742 --> 23:22.076
What do you mean pointless?

23:22.076 --> 23:23.611
Please just do it.

23:23.611 --> 23:26.672
All right! Shalanla!

23:32.020 --> 23:34.216
My ears!

23:37.959 --> 23:40.194
Maho! I'm Himeko Katagiri from Class 1-C!

23:40.194 --> 23:43.531
Yesterday Rei told me that the king crab
belongs to the same group as spiders,

23:43.531 --> 23:45.233
but spiders' shells aren't that hard, are they?

23:45.233 --> 23:45.266
But spiders' shells aren't that hard, are they?

23:45.266 --> 23:47.568
I won't be fooled! Rei, you liar!

23:47.568 --> 23:48.069
Be sure to watch the next episode, okay?!

23:48.069 --> 23:48.670
Be sure to watch the next episode, okay?!

23:48.670 --> 23:49.804
Good night!
